ui.js is unmodified from the replaywebpage 2.5.3 npm package.
sw.js was modified on 2026-10-15 to fix Wombat's constructor for React event replay:
read EventInit properties without mutating read-only native Event objects, and
apply the same proxy conversion to PointerEvent as to other UI events.
The corresponding change and reproducible bundle patch are in patch-event-init.py.
Apply it to the original package with: python3 replay/patch-event-init.py replay/sw.js
The files are hosted locally so archive playback does not depend on a CDN.
